{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123662","id":4585521771,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEVGCaw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123662","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123662.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123662.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123662","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123662/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123662/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123662/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/dbd0f4c2f2a1b7d4ec873b7f4284b3dcbf26a449","number":123662,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix triplanar texturing streaming and other custom feedback.","user":{"login":"tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven","html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes texture streaming with triplanar mapping.  The main issue was the original code tried to only use UV when determining the miplevel for a texture which under scenarios like tri-planar, it could under or over estimate the needed miplevel.\r\n\r\nThe PR fixes this by changing to a single STREAMING_LOD output and providing multiple helper functions which aid is calculating the value.  There is one for simple UV (like before), one for gradients (useful for triplanar or biplanar) and another for manually specifying the miplevel.\r\n\r\nThis PR also fixes two additional issues found.  The first issue is that visual shader had not been modified originally.  I though it used basematerial3d more when it did not.  The second issue was using STREAMING_UV in a shader while using the compatibility renderer resulted in shader compile errors.  Both are fixed and brought into alignment.\r\n\r\n- Closes #123424\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github